---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { companyInfo } from '../lib/catalog';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Tripadi International" description="What Tripadi International does with the information you give us, and what we do not do with it.">
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-900 md:text-5xl">Privacy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[16px] text-ink-600">The short version: we use what you tell us to answer you and to ship to you. We do not sell it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container-prose prose-editorial mt-10">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>When you send an enquiry:</strong> your name, company, email, phone, country and whatever you write in the message.</li>
        <li><strong>When you place a retail order:</strong> the above plus your delivery address and, if you give it, your GSTIN for the invoice.</li>
        <li><strong>In your own browser:</strong> your enquiry list and shopping bag are stored on your device so they survive a refresh. They stay on your device and are only sent to us when you submit a form.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not collect card details. Payment is handled by our payment provider and card data never reaches us.</p>

      <h2>What we do with it</h2>
      <p>
        We use it to reply to you, to quote, to make and ship your order, to raise the invoice and to
        keep the records Indian tax and export law requires us to keep. If you have asked us for a
        quote, we may follow up on it — and we will stop the moment you ask.
      </p>

      <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
      <p>Only the parties who have to, in order to do the thing you asked for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Our payment provider, for a payment you make.</li>
        <li>Our courier or freight forwarder, for a delivery.</li>
        <li>Our accountants and the tax authorities, where the law requires it.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent or trade your details to anyone, and we do not send them to a marketing list you did not ask to join.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiries: up to three years, because purchase cycles in this trade are long and a buyer often
        returns. Order and invoice records: as long as Indian tax and export law requires. You can ask
        us to delete anything we are not legally required to keep.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Write to <a href={`mailto:${companyInfo.email}`}>{companyInfo.email}</a> to see what we hold, to
        correct it, to have it deleted, or to tell us to stop contacting you. We will act on it within
        30 days.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no advertising cookies and does not track you across other websites. The
        enquiry list and bag use your browser's local storage, which is not a cookie and is not sent
        anywhere until you submit a form. If we add analytics later, this page will say so before we
        do.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        {companyInfo.name}, {companyInfo.address.city}, {companyInfo.address.state}, India ·
        <a href={`mailto:${companyInfo.email}`}>{companyInfo.email}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
